WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
A juicy and creamy tortilla pie from the oven

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.000
has literally become my husband's and kids' new favorite.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.300
All you need is a bit of cooked sausage or ham, yogurt and salt.

4
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.100
But the real secret is in the cheeses.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.780
(unclear) I use "Podgorac" cheeses,

6
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.520
because they give an incredible flavor.

7
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.720
Kashkaval stretches perfectly,

8
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.420
but that smoked cheese, folks, is the next level.

9
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.140
You lay out the tortilla, the filling,

10
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.700
then grate cheese, and so on in layers.

11
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.720
My husband and the boys love it,

12
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.960
and it's ready in no time.

13
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.720
In the oven at 180 degrees for 20 minutes,

14
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.640
and look at that.

15
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.780
The kashkaval melts, the crust is crispy,

16
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.540
and inside — incredibly creamy.

17
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.460
Write to me when you try it, and enjoy!